class:: Vwrand
summary:: Pwrand (weighted random) over visual events
categories:: Libraries>VisualServer
related:: Classes/Pwrand, Classes/Vrand, Classes/Vseq, Guides/VisualServer

description::

Returns a link::Classes/Pwrand:: that picks visual events with the given weights (same item normalisation as link::Classes/Vseq::).

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: new
argument:: list
Events or instrument symbols.
argument:: weights
An link::Classes/Array:: of weights (should sum to 1), as link::Classes/Pwrand::.
argument:: repeats
Default code::inf::.
argument:: view
Default code::\default::.
returns:: a link::Classes/Pwrand::.

EXAMPLES::

code::
Vwrand([\circle, \square, \pulse], [0.6, 0.3, 0.1], inf, \demo).vplay;
::
